    <bpmn:process id="W_W5146" name="W5146. BuildRight Property Management intercompany Lease Structuring &amp; Transfer Pricing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New site acquired or leased in landowner JV under BuildRight Property Management, Inc.
Frequency: Per site acquisition/lease execution
Volume: 10–15 lease agreements annually
Owner: Tax Manager / Corporate Controller
Participants: BuildRight Property Management Inc., BuildRight Depot Inc., Finance (VS-17.4), Legal (VS-100)
Source: workflow W5146 — BuildRight Property Management intercompany Lease Structuring &amp; Transfer Pricing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5146_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5146_Lane1" name="Tax Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5146_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5146_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5146_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5146_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5146_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5146_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5146_Start3" name="New site acquired or leased in landowner JV under BuildRight Property Management, Inc.">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5146_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5146_Task4" name="Conduct local market rental appraisal to determine arm&#x27;s-length rental rates…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Conduct local market rental appraisal to determine arm&#x27;s-length rental rates for the store site.
Responsible (R): Tax Manager / Corporate Controller
Accountable (A): Tax Manager / Corporate Controller
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5146_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5146_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5146_Task5" name="Draft intercompany lease agreement between BuildRight Property Management, Inc…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Draft intercompany lease agreement between BuildRight Property Management, Inc. (lessor) and BuildRight Depot, Inc. (lessee).
Responsible (R): Tax Manager / Corporate Controller
Accountable (A): Tax Manager / Corporate Controller
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5146_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5146_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5146_Task6" name="Submit lease structure to transfer pricing specialists to verify compliance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Submit lease structure to transfer pricing specialists to verify compliance with BIR Transfer Pricing guidelines and PFRS 16 lease accounting parameters (VS-148).
Responsible (R): Tax Manager / Corporate Controller
Accountable (A): Tax Manager / Corporate Controller
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5146_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5146_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5146_Task7" name="Execute lease agreement and configure intercompany billing schedules in ERP.">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Execute lease agreement and configure intercompany billing schedules in ERP.
Responsible (R): Tax Manager / Corporate Controller
Accountable (A): Tax Manager / Corporate Controller
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5146_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5146_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5146_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5146_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-766 (ensure controlled execution — Property Joint-Ventures, LGU Zoning Compliance &amp; Site Development Governance (PA-178.3).) | - CTL-766: Lease approved by both entity controllers; transfer pricing documentation updated annually.
Owner: Tax Manager / Corporate Controller</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
