        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Negotiate Road Right-of-Way (RROW) and easement agreements with adjacent private landowners (multi-party negotiation over weeks) to secure highway and utility connectivity.
Responsible (R): Land Liaison Officer / CSR Manager
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: 2–4 weeks elapsed (per-session effort 1–2 hours)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5148_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5148_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
