Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5148_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5148_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
